T* (4. Modelo de datos) Tj
T* (---------------------) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Severidades) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (| Severidad | Uso típico |) Tj
T* (| --- | --- |) Tj
T* (| INFO | Inventario / estado saludable |) Tj
T* (| LOW | Mejora recomendada |) Tj
T* (| MEDIUM | Riesgo moderado o degradación |) Tj
T* (| HIGH | Problema importante a remediar pronto |) Tj
T* (| CRITICAL | Riesgo inmediato o indisponibilidad |) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Finding) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Cada check produce cero o más hallazgos con: severity, check, target,) Tj
T* (message, recommendation, evidence.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* () Tj
T* (5. Checks incluidos) Tj
T* (----------------------) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Linux) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (hostname, distribution, kernel, uptime, CPU, memory, load average, filesystems,) Tj
T* (inode usage, mounts, gateway, DNS resolvers, NTP, listening ports, systemd failed units.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Docker) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (version, containers \(running/stopped/health\), resource usage, restart policy,) Tj
T* (privileged containers, containers as root, healthchecks, networks, volumes.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Network) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (DNS records, TCP port connectivity, HTTP/HTTPS status + latency, TLS expiry,) Tj
T* (issuer, SAN.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* () Tj
T* (6. Inventario YAML) Tj
T* (---------------------) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (El inventario declara hosts, servicios HTTP/TCP, registros DNS y umbrales.) Tj
T* (Las credenciales se inyectan con ${VAR} o ${VAR:-default}.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Nunca incluir passwords en claro en repositorios.) Tj
T* () Tj
